From cedb889f3acd2a24094b4674bdb67d84bf5e3f15 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guilherme Gazzo <guilherme@gazzo.xyz>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:13:06 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add USB CDC serial and capture protocol for V6.5

App takes over the USB peripheral (CDC-ACM) and exposes a line-based
command protocol: channel/timebase/trigger control, STATE?, DIAG? and
CAP? waveform transfer. Build script for modern Arm GCC (gnu99,
.thumb_func in cortexm3_macro.s). See WildcatV6.5/PROTOCOL.md.

Known issue: CAP? while running times out in AUTO; use STOP first.
